sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Browser / User
  participant Proxy as proxy.ts (clerkMiddleware)
  participant Clerk as Clerk Auth & Billing
  participant Actions as Server Actions (Next.js)
  participant Worker as Trigger.dev Worker

  User->>Proxy: Request /dashboard
  alt Not Authenticated
    Proxy-->>User: 307 Redirect to /sign-in
    User->>Clerk: Sign in (Credentials / OAuth)
    Clerk-->>User: Set __session HttpOnly cookie
  else Authenticated
    Proxy-->>User: Render Dashboard Page
  end

  User->>Actions: Invoke startChatTurn(chatId, msg, model)
  Actions->>Clerk: auth.getUser() & requireUserPaidPlan(userId)
  alt Free Account (No Pro Plan)
    Clerk-->>Actions: Missing required entitlements
    Actions-->>User: Return PaidAccessError (Prompt to Upgrade)
  else Pro Account Active
    Actions->>Clerk: Fetch privateMetadata (Decrypted API Key)
    Clerk-->>Actions: Return personal provider key
    Actions->>Worker: Start chat-agent session & mint 1h PAT
    Worker-->>Actions: Return PAT & sessionId
    Actions-->>User: Return { publicAccessToken, sessionId }
    User->>Worker: Connect direct SSE stream using PAT
  end
